Package: henge-va
Version: 1.0.1
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: Henge <henge@localhost>
Section: video
Priority: optional
Depends: libc6
Enhances: mesa-va-drivers
Description: VA-API decode surfaces for Firefox on a Henge machine
 Mesa's VA-API driver for virtio-gpu offers NV12, YV12 and I420 decode
 surfaces. FFmpeg's VA-API decoder takes I420, which Firefox refuses,
 so Firefox decodes in software. This package puts a small driver in
 front of Mesa's that offers NV12 only, the format the device decodes
 to. Mesa's driver moves to mesa_virtio_gpu_drv_video.so
 (LIBVA_DRIVER_NAME=mesa_virtio_gpu) and comes back when the package
 is removed.
